{"id":"n70865-1-9","stage":0,"title":"육교 · 天桥","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70865-1-9-1","ko":"횡단보도가 멀리 있다.","zh":"人行横道在很远的地方。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"횡단보도가","meaning":"人行横道，斑马线","explanation":"횡단보도：人行横道，斑马线；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"횡단보도","audio":"/audio/1be9bc555fce2a5014b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73246","senseId":"1","lemma":"횡단보도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"횡단보도가","audio":"/audio/85926705b5ba9deeaab3.mp3"}},{"text":"멀리","meaning":"远远地，遥远地，久远地","explanation":"멀리：远远地，遥远地，久远地。","readings":[{"term":"멀리","audio":"/audio/f62a38710e04901c3e13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54965","senseId":"1","lemma":"멀리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멀리","audio":"/audio/f62a38710e04901c3e13.mp3"}},{"text":"있다.","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1be9bc555fce2a50","term":"횡단보도","zh":"人行横道，斑马线","audio":"/audio/1be9bc555fce2a5014b7.mp3","entryId":"73246","definition":"车道上标示出来的供行人横向穿过的路。","pronunciation":["횡단보도","휑단보도"]},{"id":"f62a38710e04901c","term":"멀리","zh":"远远地，遥远地，久远地","audio":"/audio/f62a38710e04901c3e13.mp3","entryId":"54965","definition":"时间或距离相隔颇远地。","pronunciation":["멀ː리"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5a8ee6d4038030bd7ae3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70865-1-9-2","ko":"약속 시간에 늦었으니까 육교로 길을 건너자.","zh":"因为已经迟到啦，我们走天桥过马路吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"약속","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺。","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}},{"text":"시간에","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간에","audio":"/audio/6e584c2e1ef26484da55.mp3"}},{"text":"늦었으니까","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦었으니까","audio":"/audio/c3d4a9524da9302551f7.mp3"}},{"text":"육교로","meaning":"天桥，立交桥","explanation":"육교：天桥，立交桥；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"육교","audio":"/audio/ae4eff8714e3e6f28c0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70865","senseId":"1","lemma":"육교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"육교로","audio":"/audio/95ce6c521760d7a16349.mp3"}},{"text":"길을","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길을","audio":"/audio/a41fdccc5780433c53cc.mp3"}},{"text":"건너자.","meaning":"过，跨过，渡过","explanation":"건너다：过，跨过，渡过；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"건너다","audio":"/audio/07eea3489942d9d94543.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53853","senseId":"1","lemma":"건너다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건너자","audio":"/audio/4c790d1eb3187ac2e358.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a39ee87db456831e","term":"약속","zh":"约定，约好，承诺","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3","entryId":"36695","definition":"事先决定与他人一起做某事；或指那样定下的内容。","pronunciation":["약쏙"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"为了做某事而定下的时刻；或指一天中的某个时刻。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"ae4eff8714e3e6f2","term":"육교","zh":"天桥，立交桥","audio":"/audio/ae4eff8714e3e6f28c0d.mp3","entryId":"70865","definition":"横跨马路或铁路上方的桥梁。","pronunciation":["육꾜"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"07eea3489942d9d9","term":"건너다","zh":"过，跨过，渡过","audio":"/audio/07eea3489942d9d94543.mp3","entryId":"53853","definition":"越过或经过某物，移动到对面。","pronunciation":["건ː너다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c4532f7c236370360c55.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70865","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":29,"sequenceScore":1.2667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["人行横道在很远的地方。","因为已经迟到啦，我们走天桥过马路吧。","咖啡太浓了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["人行横道在很远的地方。","因为已经迟到啦，我们走天桥过马路吧。","咖啡太浓了。"],"answer":1}]}
